# Local Croupier sessions

Follow **Local servers and browser tabs** in the repository's `AGENTS.md`.
Use the shared launcher guard for normal and QA server pairs. Start from
Codex with `--no-open`, then inspect and reuse the connected browser's
existing game/lab tabs. A matching URL needs reload, not a duplicate tab;
replace an older URL in that same tab after preserving in-progress input.
When the user requests shutdown, leave the servers stopped.
